// `bb1` is entered at 1009 words from `bb0` and at 989 over the cycle edge from `bb2`, which
// the depth-first walk classifies as cycle-closing. Its sixteen `push`es overflow only from the
// first, and the lowest entry depth fits, as it would if `bb1` did not close the cycle.
